[{"title":"四皓图 其二","author":"岳正","text":"惠统安危覆手间，都将鹤发动龙颜。\n元功空佩通侯印，不及芒鞋一下山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四皓图 其三","author":"岳正","text":"谁云盛德格天难，国本将危又复安。\n试按楚歌评汉祖，沛公元不溺儒冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四皓图 其四","author":"岳正","text":"避汉逃秦智虑周，谁知亦堕子房谋。\n可怜他日安刘嘱，不及留侯及绛侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史 其一 宋太祖","author":"岳正","text":"家母素知儿有志，他人却道帝无心。\n史官兼载非相牾，后世那知费讨寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29680,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史 其二 宋太宗","author":"岳正","text":"仓卒陈桥事变时，都知不与恐难辞。\n黄袍不是寻常物，谁信军中偶得之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29681,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史 其三 杜后","author":"岳正","text":"阿母要盟毕竟寒，个中书记独相干。\n晋王不肯轻传弟，欲说陈桥事似难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读史 其四 赵普","author":"岳正","text":"两主开基失早图，判官作宰太模糊。\n鲁论本是兴王业，只恐胸中一字无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29683,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王邦饬(1)尹兰山 其一","author":"岳正","text":"郎君官已拜星郎，白发门生喜欲狂。\n莫怪老怀偏感旧，身曾见赌紫罗囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29684,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王邦饬尹兰山 其二","author":"岳正","text":"相违未满十年间，相见烦惊两鬓斑。\n衡岳雁飞犹不过，梦魂可得到兰山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29685,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄袁永州","author":"岳正","text":"山不疑人人自疑，苍梧被枉已多时。\n零陵召父经游地，莫向愚溪强赋诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29686,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭阁老仙桃图","author":"岳正","text":"度索山头一种蟠，彩霞晴映紫宸寒。\n朝回带得春风面，传与人间作画看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29687,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盛子昭画","author":"岳正","text":"半世生涯落水乡，也曾轻犯横波狂。\n日西松影长千尺，闲倚秋空数雁行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29688,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李在画为叶与中作","author":"岳正","text":"草草如荒意不荒，云根老树带疏葟。\n摩挲二十年前墨，还有谁如李在狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王孟端枯木竹石 其一","author":"岳正","text":"九龙山人已仙去，空有灵迹留人间。\n到处若无鬼神护，云气何以时往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29690,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王孟端枯木竹石 其二","author":"岳正","text":"铁网珊瑚就老时，龙宫未暇拾高枝。\n若教王恺当时有，惊杀齐奴未可知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29691,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋刻丝唐诗","author":"岳正","text":"钟王楷法盛唐风，毫忽都归组织中。\n错认郑侨称学制，经纶不数祐陵工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29692,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瘦马图","author":"岳正","text":"棱棱寒影屹如山，正坐奚官秣饲悭。\n纵使千金求骏骨，如今岂合在天闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29693,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慕邵","author":"岳正","text":"年才五十便休官，却向床头学弄丸。\n不觉冁然开口笑，邵家生活这般般。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29694,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"景陶","author":"岳正","text":"归去来兮不是辞，陶家家数正如斯。\n近来次第施行尽，只欠临流会赋诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29695,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花烛诗","author":"王彦泓","text":"四月春蚕已剥绵，困人风日嫁人天。\n不知织就鸳鸯锦，废却如花几夜眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29696,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"弄玉当年未嫁时，徘徊好影自矜持。\n几从画府回娇靥，羞向花间曳绮綦。\n千蝶帐深萦短梦，九雏钗重闲初笄。\n朝回夫婿鸣驺去，下却珠帘不肯窥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29697,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"学书不学卫夫人，度曲惟教唱柳君。\n鹦鹉自将新律教，猧儿闲取练香熏。\n镜中铸就娇颜色，帐里惊回好梦魂。\n一榻茶烟清似水，金钗划作断肠纹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29698,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"琼树瑶枝分外清，雒川应是旧仪形。\n阁中碧玉谁人识，楼上罗敷只自名。\n二尺吐云嫌髻短，五铢含雾喜身轻。\n从来不作多情调，羞读关雎第四声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29699,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"栽培艳质向瑶阶，取次帘栊不放开。\n裹手倩人收宝钿，含颦拣样画香煤。\n腰肢未许同行拟，性格还从夫婿猜。\n阿母错怜教不嫁，几回偷看画图来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29700,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"催妆诗六首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"娇羞不肯下妆台，侍女环将九子钗。\n寄语倦妆人说道，轻施朱粉学慵来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29701,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"催妆诗六首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"十步笙歌响碧霄，严妆无力夜迢迢。\n羞将双黛凭人试，留与张郎见后描。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29702,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"催妆诗六首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"说嫁心惊尽日痴，尊前玉箸镇双垂。\n不知夫婿尤怜惜，却忆娇嗔阿母时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29703,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"催妆诗六首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"羞向明窗结佩珰，穿衣宝镜暗生光。\n生憎乌鹊来相噪，默默无言下象床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29704,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"催妆诗六首 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"当初忍笑画鸳鸯，真个如今拟凤凰。\n别却群仙拜王母，已闻青鸟报刘郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29705,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"催妆诗六首 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"云作双鬟雪作肌，天教分付与男儿。\n转身拭泪银河畔，别却鸳机再不归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29706,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴行纪事 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"月钟霜瓦冻鸦啼，梦里枫桥却向西。\n暖语未终天忽晓，不堪空作醉乡迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29707,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴行纪事 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"相要不说卷衣裳，笑挽流苏背烛光。\n赖有暖言堪入骨，一宵输意作王昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29708,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴行纪事 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"绕身一步也堪怜，特地呼来放膝边。\n问道初寒身怕冷，今宵多半要装绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29709,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴行纪事 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"烧残绛蜡啼千箸，碎嚼冰蚕搅万丝。\n水国不生红豆子，赠卿何物助相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29710,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴行纪事 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"尊前一笑两相同，烛映羞颜旖旎红。\n更有销魂人不见，断云零雨数声中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29711,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴行纪事 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"爱弄黄金佛手香，不因清啭不轻尝。\n从今夺取春莺舌，只辨双柑听绕梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29712,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴行纪事 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"感郎珍重不能羞，夜浅香浓掩画楼。\n翠涩乍慵花上蝶，红酣常湿雨中鸠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29713,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯宵纪事 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"灯楼月沼映春云，箫鼓风前院院闻。\n但是酒旗歌板地，一时凄切想离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29714,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯宵纪事 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"踏雾天街艳步狂，微风一道染衣香。\n游人暗逐芳尘去，拾得儿家紫佩囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29715,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯宵纪事 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"春空淡白照银纱，一径幽寻避月华。\n记得画桥南畔去，绿杨阴下是他家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29716,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯宵纪事 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"赵李钿车昔昔游，酒边灯下共迟留。\n如何月照金堂夜，只有梅花伴莫愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29717,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"玉壶传点出花丛，青鸟衔笺尚未通。\n砌就银湾乌不度，筑成瑶圃鹤难逢。\n春浓逗梦三千里，路暗迷人十二峰。\n蜡照渐微香灺冷，佩声才达画堂东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29718,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"绕枕离怀话未穷，河梁只在此楼中。\n迎愁月剩三分白，隔泪灯摇一点红。\n有雾不曾遮别路，随风想得过花丛。\n王昌望里千回首，满院帘栊飏晓风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29719,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入吴访贺无因","author":"王彦泓","text":"心期如水较清深，未许湘波隔桂林。\n胜赏每邀雌霓句，壮情时警怒蛙吟。\n机边手爪欢何似，镜里头颅叹不禁。\n此夕吴装冷烟月，横塘清啸一相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29720,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昆季避暑分韵得清字","author":"王彦泓","text":"大地炎埃隙地清，乌衣游集葛衣新。\n已随雁序流三雅，更倚篪音奏四声。\n慕寂夫能蠲尘拂，凌寒河事慰棋枰。\n阿连更借幽心句，一夕西堂梦草生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29721,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所窥（春日访无因尚在内寝侍儿嘱余勿唤因留八句）","author":"王彦泓","text":"花影花香搅睡情，香融绣被夹罗轻。\n楚云入梦浑迷晓，蜀酒禁愁误达晨。\n曲曲银屏低拂燕，层层珠箔略闻莺。\n游人窥探栖鸳去，刻向琅玕记我曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29722,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得隔水楼高","author":"王彦泓","text":"一寸心期百尺楼，明河界作两边秋。\n移开月扇朝云出，掩过银屏夜月收。\n鬓态易迷花影乱，衣香暗接水光浮。\n残阳没后寒灯小，各自垂帘背雨愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29723,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡起","author":"王彦泓","text":"睡起即尊前，前墀霁魄圆。\n晚花疏更好，秋鸟静堪怜。\n风露当歌落，星河向酒悬。\n宿酲犹未解，于此复陶然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29724,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"王彦泓","text":"醉色风前减，茶香雨后添。\n看妆仍把卷，相对一炉烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王敬宏夫人 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"碧涧青林自掩关，调集朱粉傅双鬟。\n江陵隔岁书题绝，只道贪游未得闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王敬宏夫人 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"为探雏凤过高斋，更恋新凉未即回。\n底事江陵经岁去，桓元只合买舟来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"御君得鬼歌有流水断桥人不渡夜深孤影月明中句因广其境成篇","author":"王彦泓","text":"夜永迷灵逐恨飘，漆灯闪烁隔溪桥。\n荒涂露下千虫歇，绝壑风生万木号。\n水脉独来愁不渡，山阿谁在语相邀。\n由来地下悲秋况，还与人间共寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京口寓兴次叔闻韵 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"三山新沐翠琉璃，喜是残尊未涸时。\n出郭斜过穿苑路，傍林低度拂人枝。\n江声远和松风转，山色遥连麦浪吹。\n幽径夕阳常醉卧，往来空羡牧羊儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29729,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京口寓兴次叔闻韵 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"酒痕衫袖尚淋漓，日压重檐睡醒时。\n慕寂未能蠲弈具，寻幽何必见花枝。\n多才笔舌临江咏，入梦萧声隔院吹。\n昨夜城南新得句，愁中偷赋比红儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29730,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"半帆阁避暑","author":"王彦泓","text":"长林莽莽翠扶檐，柳下风来散午炎。\n绿粉清凝千个竹，红衣飘动万枝莲。\n云回树影移茶灶，雨送林香入酒船。\n一曲清歌高阁迥，半帆冲断夕阳烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29731,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独酌","author":"王彦泓","text":"旅酒冲愁薄，庭梅寓赏孤。\n偶来清月伴，惟与博山俱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29732,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云间独归留别叔闻于青溪归后寄之","author":"王彦泓","text":"三年无处不盘桓，客舍逢君一破颜。\n长共清尊无足恨，每闻佳句有余欢。\n闲来步缓烟郊晚，醒后谈深雨榻寒。\n今日独归翻似客，杏花狼藉不曾看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29733,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"王彦泓","text":"几层芳树几层楼，只隔欢娱不隔愁。\n花外迁延惟见影，月中寻觅略闻讴。\n吴歌凄断偏相入，楚梦微茫不易留。\n时节落花人病酒，睡魂经雨思悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29734,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瞥见（诗本不工存其深恨聊共当泣何忍长歌）","author":"王彦泓","text":"别来清减转多姿，花影长廊瞥见时。\n双鬓淡烟双袖泪，偎人刚道莫相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29735,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盈盈","author":"王彦泓","text":"盈盈一翠条，的的望中娇。\n只恐风飘去，还愁日炙销。\n迎来才得近，背去又成遥。\n路转齐回首，飞花咽百劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29736,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史三首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"不恨身短恨情长，春去空余树底芳。\n恍隔纱窗闻暗佩，欲搴重幕睹明妆。\n杯浇翠影神同醉，笔写兰仪语亦香。\n汉殿倾城真浪说，生前掩面郁金床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29737,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史三首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"冠剑纷纭出石城，偏从佳客问分明。\n只应不避兰成妒，历历莺啼说太清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29738,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史三首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"花颜玉带拥高城，迢递情人到楚荆。\n此日清油开别榻，不知传酒属何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29739,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"王彦泓","text":"倚树临楼卧酒垆，清狂判得费工夫。\n寒轻泥拔金钗饮，醉浅佯邀小玉扶。\n粉迹著书新指晕，翠痕沾袖旧眉图。\n闲来花下偏相问，昨制无题事有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29740,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕","author":"王彦泓","text":"别却天涯到画梁，天涯几处为回肠。\n横塘掠水经微雨，小院拖花过夕阳。\n飞去定寻前岁垒，舞来犹带隔林香。\n双栖碎语重檐月，梦入关河夜正长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29741,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"王彦泓","text":"回首江云泪几双，酒空金盏在他乡。\n穷途自合亲情断，幽恨那堪世事忙。\n两岸草花秋寂历，一船烟月夜凄凉。\n不知身是孤飞鸟，犹误题笺寄孟光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29742,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠冯元甫","author":"王彦泓","text":"浊醑倾罢奈愁何，客有冯驩慰放歌。\n伏枥志偿燕市价，困鲸羞借楚江波。\n更薪灭灶鸿应少，集菀辞枯鸟更多。\n肝胆只君堪付托，为抽心铁一横磨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29743,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠龚君瑞","author":"王彦泓","text":"闭户翻书有几车，青灯深夜映窗纱。\n半帘蕉雨时飘砚，一砌松风静煮茶。\n笔阵战酣蚕食叶，文心磨洗铁沉沙。\n今朝试向溪头步，几树疏梅尽著花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"所见","author":"王彦泓","text":"油壁红帘映日开，画罗氲麝逆风来。\n明妆自是怜清沼，细步还应惜落梅。\n嫁早怕逢先认客，春寒愁上最高台。\n寻幽赖有潘郎共，便到残阳且莫催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晴","author":"王彦泓","text":"柳弱不堪扶，春愁剧鹧鸪。\n翠烟三月尽，红雨一庭芜。\n晓日鸠呼妇，晴风雁引雏。\n东邻踏青女，今日在南湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠康元始归试云间","author":"王彦泓","text":"碧水东风雨脚斜，暮春离客似离家。\n牛腰诗卷青舟载，龙腹才名白社夸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题","author":"王彦泓","text":"阶前漫有忘忧草，帐里空垂辟闷犀。\n惟有相思助吟兴，一篇才了又重题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效元相体 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"梨花淡淡玉亭亭，忆得双文缟素晶。\n最是镜前欢喜处，断红蛾绿越分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]